Subject: kiln's copy of Hex records no Shards change 0002 (its dev-dependencies' shards-testwait)
Why: Hex's 0002 drops shards-testwait from the dev-dependencies of its own vendored Shards, which takes no crates/testwait; kiln's Shards takes it, and Hex in kiln builds on kiln's Shards (0004), so the change isn't kiln's: kiln's changes to Shards must be the product's.
Kiln-only: Its layout alone: Hex's own copy of Shards keeps 0002.

